  <data key="d0">Technical Specifications Table</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">The following table contains technical specifications for the EL 4.0 AEM electrolyser.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b5c89217037bf7757266979c0a494a94</data>
  <data key="d4">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1790710721</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Source Document">
  <data key="d0">Source Document</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">The source document describes the equipment as the Enapter EL 4.0 AEM electrolyser and contains the following table with technical specifications for the EL 4.0.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b5c89217037bf7757266979c0a494a94</data>
