<edge source="EL 4.0" target="Hydrogen Output Purity">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The EL 4.0 has a hydrogen output purity of 99.9% (&lt; 1,000 ppm H₂O and &lt; 5 ppm O₂) at 25 °C at 35 barg and 98.8% (&lt; 12,000 ppm H₂O and &lt; 5 ppm O₂) at 25 °C at 8 barg.</data>
