<edge source="Hydrogen Output Purity" target="Hydrogen">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The hydrogen output of the EL 4.0 has a purity of 99.9% (&lt; 1,000 ppm H₂O and &lt; 5 ppm O₂) at 25 °C at 35 barg and 98.8% (&lt; 12,000 ppm H₂O and &lt; 5 ppm O₂) at 25 °C at 8 barg.</data>
  <data key="d9">gas quality,has_parameter</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ccc2a7da10d8d7b6995d26a2b7d87a82</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1790710787</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Maximum Water Input Conductivity" target="ASTM D1193-06">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The EL 4.0 maximum water input conductivity requirement references ASTM D1193-06, with Type IV as the minimum and Type II or Type III recommended.</data>
  <data key="d9">conforms_to,water quality standard</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ccc2a7da10d8d7b6995d26a2b7d87a82</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1790710787</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Control and Monitoring" target="Enapter's EMS">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Enapter's EMS provides the fully automatic control and monitoring function of the EL 4.0, communicating via 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and Modbus TCP over Ethernet.</data>
  <data key="d9">automation,provides</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ccc2a7da10d8d7b6995d26a2b7d87a82</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1790710782</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Conformity" target="CE Mark">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The EL 4.0 conformity includes the CE mark according to the machine directive 2006/42/CE.</data>
  <data key="d9">certification,requires</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ccc2a7da10d8d7b6995d26a2b7d87a82</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1790710786</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Conformity" target="UKCA Mark">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The EL 4.0 conformity includes the UKCA mark according to the Supply Machinery (Safety) Regulations 2008.</data>
  <data key="d9">certification,requires</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ccc2a7da10d8d7b6995d26a2b7d87a82</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1790710786</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Conformity" target="CSA/ANSI B22734:2023 Ed.1">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The EL 4.0 conformity includes CSA/ANSI B22734:2023 Ed.1 for hydrogen generators using water electrolysis in industrial, commercial, and residential applications.</data>
  <data key="d9">hydrogen generator standard,requires</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ccc2a7da10d8d7b6995d26a2b7d87a82</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1790710787</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hydrogen" target="Water Electrolysis">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Water electrolysis produces hydrogen as the output gas of the EL 4.0.</data>
  <data key="d9">process output,produces</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ccc2a7da10d8d7b6995d26a2b7d87a82</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1790710784</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hydrogen" target="Oxygen">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Oxygen is present in the EL 4.0 hydrogen output at less than 5 ppm.</data>
  <data key="d9">contains,impurity</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-ccc2a7da10d8d7b6995d26a2b7d87a82</data>
  <data key="d11">Enapter_Datasheet_EL40_EN.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1790710788</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
</graph></graphml>